    feat(sidebar): unify quota-card template for allowance providers
    
    - Shared renderQuotaCard/renderQuotaRow foundation with typed extension slots
    - formatDurationCompact matching Go FormatDurationCompact (s/m/h/d)
    - opencode/ollama/kimi adapters; Kimi resets from reset_in_sec (5h/2d/23d),
      percentages preserved, Kimi/Code Monthly detail via row slot
    - Data-driven quotaProviders registry: Add Account options, step-two label,
      default name, login dispatch, delete confirm label, per-provider refresh
    - Delete flow snapshots provider/name before async, refreshes only the
      deleted provider's container (incl. fk for Kimi)
    - Shared .qact action styling (keyboard-focusable buttons)
    - RED tests + delete-flow DOM regression tests (evidence.md)
